CodeBreaker's .NET decompiler (this folder) is a C++ port of ILSpy's decompiler engine, ICSharpCode.Decompiler
(github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy, tag v11.0). Each file says which ILSpy classes it was ported from. The port's changes: the
language (C# to C++20), names in CodeBreaker's style, and the metadata read by dotnet/metadata (CodeBreaker's own reader with
System.Reflection.Metadata's interface) instead of .NET's System.Reflection.Metadata.

